---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<Page
	title="About Us"
	description="Who we are and how we write the drama stories published on our site."
>
	<p>
		{SITE_TITLE} publishes complete drama stories about the conflicts people face in everyday
		life: family arguments, relationship betrayals, workplace power struggles, wedding disasters
		and neighbor disputes.
	</p>
	<p>
		We tell every story from beginning to end, so you get the whole picture in one place instead
		of chasing scattered updates across the internet.
	</p>

	<h2>Our editorial standards</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Every story is written and edited by our team. We do not copy content from other websites.</li>
		<li>Names, places and other identifying details are changed to protect privacy.</li>
		<li>We do not publish content that targets or harasses real, identifiable people.</li>
		<li>If we get something wrong, we correct it and note the update on the story.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Get in touch</h2>
	<p>
		Have a story idea, a correction or a question? Email us at
		<a href={'mailto:' + CONTACT_EMAIL}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> or visit our
		<a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
	</p>
</Page>
